  "compatibility_impacts": [
    "Async capacities and blocking-work policy are operational and excluded from durable identity.",
    "Every evaluator embedding now requires owned task submission, completion observation, and abort.",
    "IntegrationPreflight and other shared integration services are Send + Sync; operation hooks remain Send-only.",
    "No supported API exposes manual Machine driving or a legacy execution mode.",
    "Profile advertisement remains disabled until downstream implementation and conformance evidence close.",
    "RuntimeSessionService owns post-acceptance session establishment independently of preflight.",
    "Start may complete root work before caller observation, but never before accepted-state publication.",
    "Superseded publication bytes remain isolated and cannot prove the amended contract."
  ],
